{
  "title": "Cart Storm on the Castle Wall",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Unguided rockets meet attackers with sudden mass fire today.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:rocket_arrow:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fort soldiers roll a perforated cart onto the walls.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart",
        "defense",
        "history"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:perforated_cart:roll"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wooden cart holds a flat board full of holes.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then crews stack rocket bundles under those drilled lines.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Castle commanders point defenders toward the gate below.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "defense",
        "history"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yet rockets miss single targets and reload painfully slow.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multiple launchers answer by unleashing many shots together.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Castle soldiers light strings that trail from each tube.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:fuse_bundle:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then fuses spark and crawl across the wooden deck.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:fuse_bundle:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rocket arrows blast off over the ditch at once.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:rocket_arrow:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fort defenders watch volleys spread across tight formations.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "defense"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But attackers press while crews work through slow reloads.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Castle crews wheel the cart to cover another lane.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cart"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:perforated_cart:roll"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then commanders signal another broadside toward the field.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rocket salvos fire again in rapid succession.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:rocket_arrow:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fort walls shake as smoke washes along the battlements.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "defense"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yet unguided bursts saturate space where precision cannot.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Castle ramparts anchor the cart beside crenel stones.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "defense"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then crews pause and clear hot sticks and ash.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Castle defenders hold positions while rockets sweep the approach.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "defense"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle",
        "obj:rocket_arrow:fire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mass fire beats careful aim here.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
      "picture": [
        "set:castle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unguided rockets meet attackers with sudden fire.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "rockets"
      ],
